Subject: Support RISC-V and the current Buck2 prelude
Upstream: https://github.com/buck2hub/cargo-buckal
Upstream-Status: Pending

Select the RISC-V toolchain and allow the distribution host triple to
be set for build scripts. Recognize Rust targets after the prelude
moved rule declarations to a separate module.

